From f01890f764ab80b4a7ba55d3506ebc49b6ca4159 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:55:17 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Replace event date with starts_at datetime

Swap starts_on DATE for starts_at DATETIME, validated as Y-m-d H:i and
rejected when earlier than the current minute. The form uses a
datetime-local input; the model normalizes its T separator and the
seconds returned by MySQL.
